  "authoringNote": "The continuous object is the timing diagram: one html layer runs the whole film, keeps its ruler and its rows across every cut, and re-slopes as each preset's stagger changes. sceneUnits is off so the cuts do not chop it into four islands. The film shows three presets, REJECTS the reading that this is a typeface choice (strike), and names what it is instead (wordSlot).",
