      "no-continuous-object": "the diagram IS the spine and it changes at every cut: each junction swaps its whole bar chart for the next preset's. direction-floor cannot see it because its `var(--t)` exemption tests `l.html` and this layer carries its markup in `src`. A gate blind spot, not a missing spine."
    }
  },
